---
title: "Turn / Runner / Queue Lifecycle (ZCE-6)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: setup
    lg1: active
    lg2: blocked
    lg3: steer
    lg4: closing
    lg5: terminal
    lg6: fault
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 orange
  class lg3 purple
  class lg4 yellow
  class lg5 tan
  class lg6 pink
  s0: Idle (待抢锁)
  s1: Lock Held (已持 worktree 锁)
  s2: Cleaning (finally 关连接/删密钥/解锁)
  s3: Connected (队列待发)
  s4: CheckingAttempts (bumpAttempts 后核限)
  s5: Failed (失败收场#65292;零残留)
  s6: Running (回合执行中)
  s7: Connected (队列已空)
  s8: Blocked (pending.json 挂起等人工)
  s9: Steer Queued (guide 插话在飞)
  s10: Timed Out (触发 stop + 5s 宽限)
  s11: Cancelling (已发 session/stop)
  s12: Exited (子进程异常退出#65292;保留队列重投)
  s13: Cancelled (已取消结算#65292;零残留)
  s14: Settled (正常完成#65292;零残留)
  s15: Timeout Settled (超时结算#65292;零残留)
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: tryLinkLock 成功持锁
  s1 --> s2: spawn/attach 失败进 finally
  s1 --> s3: 写临时密钥并 spawn + attach
  s2 --> s5: close + dispose + 解锁 -> Failed
  s3 --> s4: nextQueueFile + bumpAttempts
  s4 --> s6: attempts <= MAX_ATTEMPTS 发起 send
  s6 --> s7: turn.completed(success) 出队
  s6 --> s2: 子进程退出保留队列重投
  s6 --> s8: 落盘 pending.json 挂起
  s6 --> s9: inTurnWatcher 发送 guide 插话
  s6 --> s10: 回合超时发 session/stop
  s6 --> s11: 运行中 cancel 发 session/stop
  s7 --> s2: 队列已空收场
  s2 --> s12: close + dispose + 解锁 -> Exited
  s8 --> s6: 消费 answer.json 恢复执行
  s8 --> s2: 子进程退出保留队列重投
  s8 --> s11: 挂起期间 cancel 替答 deny/decline
  s8 --> s10: 回合超时发 session/stop
  s9 --> s7: turn.completed(success) 出队
  s9 --> s2: 子进程退出保留队列重投
  s9 --> s6: turn.steerDrained 生效 or startNow 误起回合发 v4 stop
  s9 --> s10: 回合超时发 session/stop
  s9 --> s11: steerQueued 期间 cancel
  s10 --> s2: gate.close() 结算 timeout
  s11 --> s2: cancel 生效或宽限到期结算 cancelled or cancel 竞态撞上已完成保留 done
  s2 --> s13: close + dispose + 解锁 -> Cancelled
  s2 --> s14: close + dispose + 解锁 -> Settled
  s2 --> s15: close + dispose + 解锁 -> TimeoutSettled
